1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,210
(Howard:)Why is that Mrs. Wolowitz crying?

2
00:00:02,378 --> 00:00:05,378
Oh, that's Anaïs. None of the
other girls in the house like her.

3
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:08,256
(Howard:)House? What house?

4
00:00:08,676 --> 00:00:11,716
- They all live in a house together.
- A house? Where?

5
00:00:12,388 --> 00:00:13,848
(Penny:)I don't know. Somewhere in L.A.

6
00:00:14,807 --> 00:00:16,387
(Howard:)Wait a minute.

7
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:22,566
(Howard:)You're telling me
that I'm within driving distance...

8
00:00:22,731 --> 00:00:26,731
(Howard:)...of a house filled
with aspiring supermodels?

9
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:28,566
(Penny:)Yeah, I guess.

10
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:33,073
(Howard:)And they live together
and shower together...

11
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:36,870
(Howard:)...and have naked pillow fights?

12
00:00:39,498 --> 00:00:43,168
- Hey, where are you going?
- To pay my cable bill.

13
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:46,843
(Sheldon:)All right, pencils down.

14
00:00:47,006 --> 00:00:49,716
(Sheldon:)I have lokh, makh...

15
00:00:49,884 --> 00:00:55,024
(Sheldon:)...and cherrrkh. Anybody got those?

